window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>No one said being Sacramento’s only paranormal P.I. was going to be easy.</p> <p></p> <p>Face your fears. It’s such a tired cliché. Yet that’s what August Watson must do if he is to survive.</p> <p></p> <p>His self-appointed nemesis, a ghost of a man called Daniel Quinn, has taken Glacia and August must play Quinn’s deadly games if he is to stand any chance of getting her back.</p> <p></p> <p>On the run from the police, forced to do it all alone, August must face his greatest nightmares. He will triumph or he will die. But if he dies, it won’t be only his life that is forfeit.</p> <p></p> <p>Out of options, out of time, the rage within might keep him alive, but will it also consume him?</p>"; 
